      </a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main id="maincontent" tabindex="-1">
    <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-heading">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">Fall collection now live</p>
        <h1 id="hero-heading">Elevated essentials for sharper everyday living.</h1>
        <p class="hero-text">
          Discover weather-ready apparel, refined home goods, and travel pieces selected for lasting performance.
        </p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
