            <p>Our stylists break down the materials, silhouettes, and carry pieces that simplify shoulder-season packing.</p>
          </div>
        </article>

        <div class="story-list" aria-label="More editorial stories">
          <article>
            <p class="category">Design</p>
            <h3><a href="#">Inside the return of tactile home accessories</a></h3>
